        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black 7-7/8 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are looking for a modern recessed pull, this 7-7/8 Inch Black Flush Pull just might end that search. Its sleek, rectangular shape and hot black finish makes this pocket door pull a must have for any contemporary home. Flush pulls like this one can be used in many applications including used as pocket door hardware or as cabinet pulls on lightweight drawers. This 7-7/8 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull in Black looks especially great contrasting light cabinets in your kitchen remodel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-718-200-p22-specifications.gif?v=1704354737\" width=\"504\" height=\"396\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Stainless Steel Flush Pull  Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/11-13-16-inch-black-flush-pull\"><b>11-13/16 Inch Black Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/15-3-4-inch-black-flush-pull\"><b>15-3/4 Inch Black Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 7-7/8\" Stainless Steel Flush Pull in Black:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 7-7/8\" (200 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/16\" (56 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\" (13 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/16\" (11 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 6-11/16\" (170 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1-1/32\" (26 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 7-5/8\" (194 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-15/16\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\">Flush Door Pulls</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
